=== Attach ===
Ticks attach themselves to the player and suck blood from them every 0.5 seconds (50 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage). This lasts 5 seconds, dealing damage ten times; parrying the attack forces them to detach. Each attack reaches 1 meter in a 40-degree horizontal arc. The hitbox is calculated from the center of Ticks; this fact combined with the incredibly small hitbox, it is possible for a Tick to attach and be unable to do damage due to not being able to reach the player — especially if they are moving.

